# steps/table-receiver.md §10: the statement `k: Counter\n` at the root of the part
# unit_s7_part_root_ns_refused_part.lm2 (harness Parts) is its root's procedure's, which reads the program as
# a method of the part does -- nothing of the source by its place: "unresolved name" at Counter, in the part
# (read by place, as a procedure of the source reads, it is accepted).
Counter:
    size_t: n 4U
end: Counter
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
